# Zipmater — Feature Tracker

Zipmater is the gig-worker delivery platform: medical couriers, same-day and last-mile drivers,
food and grocery delivery, white glove, furniture and moving help. It was hard-forked from Shipmater
(which stays focused on trucking — companies, dispatchers, CDL drivers).

Terminology: in the UI, **Client** = the person or business sending (`shipper` in code/DB) and
**Courier** = the gig worker (`carrier` in code/DB). Model, table, route and role names were kept
as-is to avoid a risky migration rewrite.

